      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Gas units measured on a mainnet fork; prices read 2026-11-05\nOne-shot rehearsal (7 steps): resolver 178k, 4 grants 351k,\n9 records 868k, setResolver 40k = 1.44M gas\n-> about $0.43 at 0.125 gwei, $0.79 at 0.244 gwei, $17 at 5 gwei\nPublisher (recurring): first write 366k, overwrite 85k\n-> no registration fee: mergit.eth is owned (expires 2027-11-05)\n-> team holds 0.3 USDC on mainnet; USDC cannot pay gas",
      "originalText": "Gas units measured on a mainnet fork; prices read 2026-11-05\nOne-shot rehearsal (7 steps): resolver 178k, 4 grants 351k,\n9 records 868k, setResolver 40k = 1.44M gas\n-> about $0.43 at 0.125 gwei, $0.79 at 0.244 gwei, $17 at 5 gwei\nPublisher (recurring): first write 366k, overwrite 85k\n-> no registration fee: mergit.eth is owned (expires 2027-11-05)\n-> team holds 0.3 USDC on mainnet; USDC cannot pay gas",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
